---
// A component whose <style is:global> block is the only rule for its element: the panel edits that
// block from the page, so the edit cycle's component-block source writes this file.
---
<p class="soak-gcard" id="soak-gcard">A component paragraph styled by its global block.</p>

<style is:global>
  .soak-gcard {
    color: rgb(150, 60, 20);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }
</style>
